+  'to him, search ' + SF_WHERE + ', and lead the block with the result: a confident match turns the ' +
+  'proposal into adding the finding to that ticket; no match is one line. Ignore this if the reply is ' +
+  'not actually proposing a new ticket.' + SF_CODA;
